@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #356553
skinparam LineColor #356553
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F4F7EF
skinparam classBorderColor #356553
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F4F7EF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #356553
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F4F7EF
skinparam stateBorderColor #356553
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF6DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C7AB63
hide empty members
title 交班与活动结转活动图
start
:处理班次草稿和待收款单；核对退款与换货;
:应交 = 备用金 + 现金销售 - 本班现金退款 + 换货现金净差价;
:员工填写实交、原因，提交交班;
:冻结本班后续现金操作;
if (管理员核对通过?) then (通过)
:交班 VERIFIED;
else (退回)
:交班 RETURNED；重新清点、提交;
stop
endif
:关班；退回剩余展位库存并完成在途签收;
if (存在未完班次/单据/库存/调拨/未核交班?) then (是)
:活动不能关闭，按原因处理;
stop
else (否)
:活动 CLOSED;
endif
:按员工和币种归集未结佣金（含以前的负流水）;
if (合计为正?) then (是)
:OWNER 准备结算，占用流水;
:线下支付，登记付款凭证，PAID;
else (零或负)
:负数保留，抵扣后续活动佣金;
endif
:付款后发生退货时新增负佣金，不改旧结算;
stop
@enduml
